{"4509920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sunrise Isles", "steam_appid": 4509920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/c939df022529027002b1da3af241edc3.poster.avif?t=1781541890\" aria-label=\"Welcome to Sunrise Isles!\" width=800 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/c939df022529027002b1da3af241edc3.webm?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/c939df022529027002b1da3af241edc3.mp4?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sunrise Isles is a cozy hangout game where you and your friends can explore a small-but-spacious island, take on roles that fulfill other players' needs, or just chill and talk!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/7d43d0ea8cae140223b6b2f9e6a334e0.poster.avif?t=1781541890\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/7d43d0ea8cae140223b6b2f9e6a334e0.webm?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/7d43d0ea8cae140223b6b2f9e6a334e0.mp4?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SO MUCH TO DO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>chopping trees</strong> to <strong>driving cargo trucks</strong>, you'll always have something to do! <strong>Catch fish</strong>, <strong>cook them</strong> on the wood you chopped and enjoy a <strong>fresh smoothie</strong> from all the <strong>fruit gathering</strong> you've done along the way. Not your style? Maybe you'd prefer to <strong>design clothes</strong> for the island's residents! Use cotton to create fashionable outfits for you and your friends. You could be a <strong>home decorator</strong> and build the furniture and appliances for the island's houses! Perhaps a <strong>farmer</strong> that grows the island's most reliable supply of crops? You could even <strong>be a driver</strong> and haul goods all across the island for whoever may need things from different regions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/c2018a86ff6d27993785fccc01a899ea.poster.avif?t=1781541890\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/c2018a86ff6d27993785fccc01a899ea.webm?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/c2018a86ff6d27993785fccc01a899ea.mp4?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOK YOUR BEST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilizing a wide array of eyes and body patterns with full control over the colors, <strong>create your very own cute avatar</strong> that instantly shows off your personality to others online. You can even customize your dialogue bubbles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/df2b738ddf0e61e0a8b30313bf7d4d4f.poster.avif?t=1781541890\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/df2b738ddf0e61e0a8b30313bf7d4d4f.webm?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/df2b738ddf0e61e0a8b30313bf7d4d4f.mp4?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A LIVING ISLAND, FROM DAWN TO DUSK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the calm waves at the <strong>beach</strong> to the howling winds of the <strong>alpine forest</strong>, there's always something whispering in your ear. Birds, butterflies, cicadas and more are the island's natural inhabitants, and they're happy to make themselves known! All of the various <strong>regions provide different resources</strong>, as well as their own geographical and traversal challenges. With a <strong>full weather system</strong> and <strong>day-and-night cycles</strong>, every day on the island feels fresh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/fcdc5b0c79653952e2ea3b4206b6f144.poster.avif?t=1781541890\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/fcdc5b0c79653952e2ea3b4206b6f144.webm?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/fcdc5b0c79653952e2ea3b4206b6f144.mp4?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHATTING'S A JOY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chatting isn't just how you speak to others on the island. Messages have you &quot;talking&quot; in an adorable voice, and by utilizing special characters, you can even <strong>control the pitch and tempo</strong> of each word, allowing you to <strong>sing songs!</strong> Not only that, but holding an <strong>instrument</strong> will have you playing it instead of talking, letting you <strong>perform music</strong> to any willing audience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/563db5c960e7cb9f53654f62b124e55c.poster.avif?t=1781541890\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/563db5c960e7cb9f53654f62b124e55c.webm?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/563db5c960e7cb9f53654f62b124e55c.mp4?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TAKE IT EASY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if nobody takes on a role, the island lives on and <strong>characters never get hurt.</strong> You <i>can</i> help out, but if you just want to hang out and chill, that's great - I created the island to be a cozy hangout spot!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/c939df022529027002b1da3af241edc3.poster.avif?t=1781541890\" aria-label=\"Welcome to Sunrise Isles!\" width=800 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/c939df022529027002b1da3af241edc3.webm?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/c939df022529027002b1da3af241edc3.mp4?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sunrise Isles is a cozy hangout game where you and your friends can explore a small-but-spacious island, take on roles that fulfill other players' needs, or just chill and talk!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/7d43d0ea8cae140223b6b2f9e6a334e0.poster.avif?t=1781541890\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/7d43d0ea8cae140223b6b2f9e6a334e0.webm?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/7d43d0ea8cae140223b6b2f9e6a334e0.mp4?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SO MUCH TO DO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>chopping trees</strong> to <strong>driving cargo trucks</strong>, you'll always have something to do! <strong>Catch fish</strong>, <strong>cook them</strong> on the wood you chopped and enjoy a <strong>fresh smoothie</strong> from all the <strong>fruit gathering</strong> you've done along the way. Not your style? Maybe you'd prefer to <strong>design clothes</strong> for the island's residents! Use cotton to create fashionable outfits for you and your friends. You could be a <strong>home decorator</strong> and build the furniture and appliances for the island's houses! Perhaps a <strong>farmer</strong> that grows the island's most reliable supply of crops? You could even <strong>be a driver</strong> and haul goods all across the island for whoever may need things from different regions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/c2018a86ff6d27993785fccc01a899ea.poster.avif?t=1781541890\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/c2018a86ff6d27993785fccc01a899ea.webm?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/c2018a86ff6d27993785fccc01a899ea.mp4?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOK YOUR BEST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilizing a wide array of eyes and body patterns with full control over the colors, <strong>create your very own cute avatar</strong> that instantly shows off your personality to others online. You can even customize your dialogue bubbles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/df2b738ddf0e61e0a8b30313bf7d4d4f.poster.avif?t=1781541890\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/df2b738ddf0e61e0a8b30313bf7d4d4f.webm?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/df2b738ddf0e61e0a8b30313bf7d4d4f.mp4?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A LIVING ISLAND, FROM DAWN TO DUSK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the calm waves at the <strong>beach</strong> to the howling winds of the <strong>alpine forest</strong>, there's always something whispering in your ear. Birds, butterflies, cicadas and more are the island's natural inhabitants, and they're happy to make themselves known! All of the various <strong>regions provide different resources</strong>, as well as their own geographical and traversal challenges. With a <strong>full weather system</strong> and <strong>day-and-night cycles</strong>, every day on the island feels fresh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/fcdc5b0c79653952e2ea3b4206b6f144.poster.avif?t=1781541890\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/fcdc5b0c79653952e2ea3b4206b6f144.webm?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/fcdc5b0c79653952e2ea3b4206b6f144.mp4?t=1781541890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHATTING'S A JOY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chatting isn't just how you speak to others on the island. Messages have you &quot;talking&quot; in an adorable voice, and by utilizing special characters, you can even <strong>control the pitch and tempo</strong> of each word, allowing you to <strong>sing songs!</strong> Not only that, but holding an <strong>instrument</strong> will have you playing it instead of talking, letting you <strong>perform music</strong> to any willing audience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/563db5c960e7cb9f53654f62b124e55c.poster.avif?t=1781541890\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509920/extras/563db5c960e7cb9f53654f62b124e55c.webm?t=1781541890\" type=\"